<title>USA: Alternative Living completes financing.</title>
<headline>Alternative Living completes financing.</headline>
<dateline>BROOKFIELD, Wis. 1997-01-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Alternative Living Services Inc said it completed a $45 million sale-leaseback financing arrangement with Meditrust SBI, a health care real estate investment trust.</p>
<p>The deal represents the first transaction completed under a $250 million letter of intent with Meditrust for construction and acquisition financing.</p>
<p>The $45 million transaction was completed on 12 residences located in four states.</p>
<p>&quot;This closing is consistent with our plans to implement an aggressive growth strategy over the next 24 months,&quot; said president William Lasky in a statement.</p>
<p>Alternative Living operates 77 assisted-living residences.</p>
<p>	 ((Chicago newsdesk 312 408-8787))</p>
